WEBVTT

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:18.940
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.420
Thank you, Catchick!

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.170
She was scared of you!

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.970
Give me back my Hanako!

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.210
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:32.490
I know Daddy Eyeball-san said, "the world
you see isn't all there is..."

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:34.640
But, this is totally visible, right...?

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:38.280
What is this?

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:49.300
CHAPTER 10

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:53.700
VANISHING! THE SEVEN SCHOOL MYSTERIES

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:10.760
I'm tired of house-sitting...

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:20.140
It's a little filthy.
That's the problem with bachelor pads...

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:28.570
Wow!

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:31.510
You made everything so shiny!

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.630
Thank you, Catchick!

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:38.160
I guess I'll make
an exception and clean...

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.660
Hey, Kitaro, you home?

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:43.350
Old Man Crybaby.

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:45.920
You're drunk while
it's still light out again.

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.920
I still haven't had enough to drink.

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:54.130
Kitaro's gone with Daddy Eyeball-san
for a two-night stay at the hot springs.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:56.150
I'm sure there was some <i>sake</i> here...

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:58.060
There it is!

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:00.040
Are you listening to me?

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:02.230
Sure I am.

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:05.650
Cleaning Kitaro's room while he's away.

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:08.630
You're pretty thoughtful, Catchick.

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:11.860
Wh-Why would I clean Kitaro's house?!

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:16.240
Mana...?

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:20.830
<i>Cat-san, there's something I want
your help with...</i>

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:26.920
Recently, some strange things
have been going on at school.

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.610
Strange things...?

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:32.810
I get the feeling that someone's
watching me during class.

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:43.870
When I'm stuck on an exam problem,

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:47.330
I hear a voice that gives me the answer.

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:49.230
But, that answer...

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:52.360
Uh, "Every dog has..."

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:53.970
"...his food."

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:55.130
Huh?!

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:56.710
Really?

00:04:57.320 --> 00:05:01.040
But the scariest was in my lunch box...

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:04.360
What?!

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:12.440
If it was me,
I'd happily feast on that fish.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:13.960
Cat-san...

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:17.220
Oh! And earlier, in my shoe cubby...

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:22.530
You know what a black lily means?

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:25.770
It means, "curse."

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:26.920
Huh...

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:33.650
Schools have always been prone to
<i>yokai</i> living in them.

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:37.630
You know how every school
has its Seven School Mysteries?

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:40.350
Those are usually <i>yokai</i> playing pranks.

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:43.540
Come to think of it,
our school has those...

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:47.460
The art room design statue
that cries blood.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:49.750
The laughing anatomical model.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.460
The running statue of Kinjiro Ninomiya.

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:55.710
The man-faced dog that lives in
the connecting corridor.

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:59.970
The portrait of Beethoven that comes out
and plays the piano.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:02.930
Hanako-san who lives in
the third-floor girls' room.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.890
Yosuke-kun who lives in
the second-floor boys' room.

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:09.460
I've never heard of Yosuke-kun,

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:13.090
but Hanako's a friend of mine,
so why don't I ask her?

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:15.980
Wow! You're amazing, Cat-san!

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:22.100
But I don't think the Seven
School Mysteries are involved with this...

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:23.160
How come?

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:28.580
Because I haven't heard any rumors of
the Seven School Mysteries recently...

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:34.670
Hanako, it's me, Catchick.
Say something if you're there.

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:38.820
She's gone...

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:40.020
See?

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:48.770
This is my classroom.

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:01.220
It's wet...

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:03.660
Could it be the <i>yokai</i>, Desk-licker...?

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:05.720
There's no such <i>yokai</i>.

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:07.660
Then how did this happen?

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:09.650
Shh! Quiet!

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.190
Something's close.

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:14.040
A <i>yokai</i>?

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:18.030
It's not Hanako
or the Seven School Mystery <i>yokai</i>.

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:20.590
Something's definitely here.

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:22.930
I thought so. What should we do?

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.580
Don't worry.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:27.330
Leave it to me, the NyaNyaNya no Catchick.

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:30.170
I'll find it and tear it limb from limb...

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:35.790
Dammit... What is she doing here?

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:42.700
All I wanted to do was clean Mana-chan's
desk and put these flowers on it...

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:47.450
Oh, ever since I met Mana-chan
on that rainy day, I...

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:52.230
It's no good. I'm hungry...

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:54.830
I haven't eaten anything in a week.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:59.570
Plus my body's covered with <i>yokai</i> mold.

00:07:59.570 --> 00:08:03.590
It's over. I can't move anymore...

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:10.220
What is this?

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:19.890
F-Food...

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:21.190
Huh?

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:23.020
Rat Man-san?!

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:25.840
I'm hungry...

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:28.160
Have you got anything to eat?

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:33.570
Um...

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:38.270
If this bread will do... take it.

00:08:48.030 --> 00:08:49.970
Oh, Mana-chan.

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:52.460
I received your feelings loud and clear.

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:57.480
And, even now,
I carry it with me at all times.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:09:00.230
The proof of your love you gave me...

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:02.510
Rub, rub.

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:08.270
But, Mana-chan, you're an angel
and I'm a dirty sewer rat...

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:13.080
Even if we love each other,
the world won't allow it.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.500
That's why I decided

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:21.710
to protect you in secret from the shadows
and support you!

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:28.340
<i>O-Oh crap!</i>

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:50.030
Must be my imagination...

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:57.460
There's no one here after all!

00:09:57.730 --> 00:10:01.140
Hmm... It looks like I was mistaken.

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:08.340
Cat-san, let's go home.

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:09.890
I guess so...

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.180
Who's there?! Stop!

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:17.490
I can't get caught here!

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:20.810
The water's great...

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:24.420
It feels like we could stay in here
for hours, right Dad?

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:26.990
Huh? That there is...

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:28.590
Nure-Onna?

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:32.090
Come to think of it, this hot spring
allows mixed bathing.

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:43.040
See you later.

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:53.740
Hanako-san.

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:55.170
Oh?

00:10:55.490 --> 00:10:58.750
Kitaro-san, and Daddy Eyeball-san.

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:00.440
Well, well.

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:04.750
It's not often we see you come to
the hot springs, Hanako-san.

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:07.150
You're usually in the school bathroom.

00:11:07.150 --> 00:11:09.590
I got scared and ran.

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:12.160
I can't go back to that school anymore...

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:17.660
Huh, what could scare you so much
you'd run away, Hanako-san?

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:21.980
Now that she's involved, this is bad...

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:33.140
HANAKO-SAN

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:37.640
READING TOGETHER

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:36.580
<i>-"Wobble, wobble."
-"Shake, shake."</i>

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:37.580
<i>"What is this guy...?"</i>

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:43.440
I'm pretty sure it ran this way...

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:53.820
Settle down, Catchick.

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:56.680
Ooh, Mana-chan's here too.

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:58.910
What's going on, everyone?

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:01.600
We're here for a night drink at school!

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:02.980
-Get serious!
-Ouch!

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:07.590
Actually, for the past few months,
we've lost contact with Nino.

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:08.650
Nino...?

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:11.550
Kinjiro Ninomiya. See?

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:15.390
Even though we've messaged him,
they haven't been read.

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:13.410
<i>-"How are you?"
-"Want to get some tea?"</i>

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:15.320
<i>-"What's wrong?"
-"Not feeling good?"</i>

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:18.890
So we got worried and decided to
come see how he's doin'.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:20.830
You came just in time.

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:23.890
We spotted someone suspicious
and were chasing it.

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:26.010
Do you think it got Nino?!

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.470
I'll wring its neck!

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.940
Oh come on. Give me a break.

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:34.600
Honestly, what's with everyone
getting in the way?

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:36.260
Ow!

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:39.330
Why was there a wall built here?

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:42.310
Wait, it's Wally Wall?!

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:43.580
Wally...

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:49.550
What's wrong, Wally Wall?!

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:52.800
Ran. This way.

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:55.300
You've cornered it in the bathroom.

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.260
Nice goin', Wally Wall!

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:59.240
Let's charge in!

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:00.720
Now to drink!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:11.430
We know you're in there!
Surrender and come out!

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:14.800
Why is this happening?!

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:18.570
What did I do to deserve this, dammit?!

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:21.060
So you won't open up...

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:22.330
Oh!

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:23.850
What's wrong?

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:27.040
This is the second-floor boys' room...

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:30.210
The Seven School Mysteries' Yosuke-kun...?

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:32.310
Who's Yosuke-kun?

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:34.610
Isn't it Hanako-san?

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:36.380
What about Hanako?

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:41.240
Rat Man?!

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:43.850
What are you doing here?

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:47.440
So all of this was your doing?!

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:49.130
Th-That's not it!

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:52.630
I-I-It's the same reason as
Sand Witch and the others.

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:55.190
I wanted to protect
Mana-chan from <i>yokai</i>!

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:57.220
It's true! I'm not lying!

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:59.320
Seems suspicious.

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:00.930
You've gotta believe me!

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:03.260
More importantly, he appeared...

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:10.420
YOSUKE-KUN

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:13.710
Oh my, isn't he handsome!

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:17.090
It's you... It's you...

00:14:18.430 --> 00:14:21.180
We ain't gonna let ya
lay a hand on this girl!

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:23.660
I'm not interested in that girl.

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.140
I have business...

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:29.900
with you!

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:33.550
L-Let go of me!

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:38.300
Oh dear. They're gone.

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:39.760
Thank goodness!

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:41.240
It's not good at all!

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:44.680
So, who the heck is Yosuke-kun?

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:47.000
Why'd he go after Rat Man?

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:49.370
Maybe he's into guys instead?

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:53.920
The feeling didn't seem mutual.
Er, wait, I didn't mean...

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:57.020
Oh well. I guess
we should go and save him.

00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:03.220
No one's here...

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:11.940
Nino!

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:17.970
These are all the Seven School Mysteries!

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:20.530
They were all dangled from up here...

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:25.160
That's why no one saw them
and there haven't been rumors recently.

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:28.790
I-I'm here too! Help me!

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:32.000
Why is Rat Man dangling up there too?

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:35.340
It's because he tried to
approach my Hanako...

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:38.610
No I didn't! I don't know any Hanako!

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:41.700
Only Mana-chan is my angel...

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:43.050
Oops.

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:45.490
My angel?

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:46.560
Me?

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:53.040
Our secret love!

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:54.940
Is he your boyfriend?

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:57.320
Huh? No, he isn't.

00:15:57.320 --> 00:16:01.590
He's not my boyfriend, he's a friend...
Wait, I guess not.

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:02.820
He's just some guy I know.

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:07.200
Just some... guy... I... know...

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:12.390
See? You really are after Hanako!

00:16:12.390 --> 00:16:15.290
You meant to send those flowers
to Hanako, didn't you?!

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:17.840
No, no! You got it all wrong!

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:20.580
I don't know any Hanako!

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:23.590
Ow, ow, ow...

00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:29.140
Stop! What did you do to my Hanako?!

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:32.640
Huh. You're getting stalked, Hanako-san?

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:36.000
That's right.
It's a <i>yokai</i> named Yosuke-kun...

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:39.650
He got the wrong idea
just because I was a little nice to him...

00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:42.970
After all, you're pretty cute, Hanako-san.

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:48.890
He got jealous of
the other <i>yokai</i> in the school

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:51.950
and took them away somewhere
one after another.

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:55.580
I was just so scared...

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:57.330
Stop!

00:16:57.650 --> 00:17:00.500
Give me back my Hanako!

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:03.920
Give her back!
What did you do with Hanako?!

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:06.080
Hold it right there!

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:08.450
Yosuke, was it?

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:12.060
Hanako never told me anything about you.

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:14.690
Were you really a couple?

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:19.960
That's right! Hanako's shy
so she never said it out loud,

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:22.820
but she loved me!

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:25.820
She accepted my love!

00:17:27.030 --> 00:17:29.050
Huh. So, what'd ya do?

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:31.480
I sent her gifts every day.

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:38.080
I put flowers in the third floor
girls' room where she lives.

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:42.090
I always, always, constantly...

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:45.470
watched over Hanako!

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:48.680
Yosuke, you're...

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:51.310
Gross.

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:53.270
Wh-What?!

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:56.000
A girl ain't gonna fall for ya like that.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:59.650
It's completely one-sided. A crush.

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:02.520
He's just a two-bit stalker.

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:06.680
Th-That's not true!
Hanako liked me too!

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:09.110
I know because when I was in trouble...

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:14.020
There's no paper...

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:22.800
Paper!

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:25.210
Somebody! Somebody!

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:28.720
Give me some paper!

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:34.040
Um...

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:36.220
Go ahead and use this.

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:42.190
She saved me in a time of peril!

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.730
That's it?

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:47.990
I get it... I get it, Yosuke.

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:51.620
Your innocence.
Your straight-forward love!

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:53.180
You understand?

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:56.120
Yeah. We're kindred spirits!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:03.150
Hey! Don't you dare make fun of
a man's innocence!

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:06.360
What innocence?
He's just making an assumption.

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:08.840
One that's convenient for him!

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:10.740
What?

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:13.080
Oh, that must be it.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:16.790
Yosuke, I bet she's bitter that
she's unpopular

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:19.850
and misled Hanako with some lie!

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:20.750
What?!

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:22.210
You won't fool us!

00:19:22.210 --> 00:19:24.570
Really? Is that true?

00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:29.320
You meant to tear me and Hanako apart
from the beginning?!

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:33.220
Listen, Hanako ran away.

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:35.030
She was scared of you!

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:37.310
Wrong! Wrong! Wrong!

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:38.540
It's not wrong!

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:41.790
Wake up already, you stalker ghost!

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:45.290
Don't make fun of my love!

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:55.680
My fists will wake up
that daydreaming head of yours!

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:02.600
You're so cool, Cat-san!

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:06.210
Get this through your thick skull!

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:10.240
What you're doing is selfishly forcing
your own emotions onto her!

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:14.880
It's not love at all!

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:35.680
Wally Wall.

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:39.040
Handsome or not, being a stalker ruins it.

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:44.310
So, was that Yosuke <i>yokai</i> the one
who was playin' tricks on Mana-chan?

00:20:44.310 --> 00:20:48.000
Either way, case closed! Let's drink!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.540
Hey! Want me to kiss you?!

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:53.570
Thank you, Cat-san!

00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:58.330
Sand Witch-san, Old Man Crybaby-san,
Rollo Cloth-san,

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:00.350
and Wally Wall-san, too.

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:03.330
Thank you so much for protecting me!

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:10.640
Wally Wall.

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:15.380
These sweet buns taste great!

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:17.310
Thanks for house-sitting.

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:21.270
Wanna come with us next time, Catchick?

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:25.350
I don't want to go to a hot spring.

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:28.170
If anywhere, I'd like to go overseas.

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:31.030
Take me someplace like New York or Dubai.

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:34.550
By the way, what happened to Rat Man?

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:38.180
He said he's going off on a trip
to heal his wounded heart.

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:40.620
What wounded heart?

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:41.990
No idea.

00:21:42.410 --> 00:21:45.100
It looks like Wally Wall's missing, too.

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:47.960
Oh, about Wally Wall...

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:52.920
Apparently he's become one of
Mana's school's Seven School Mysteries.

00:21:57.570 --> 00:22:01.000
Wally Wall.

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.420
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.420
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:08.790
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:08.790
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:11.460
<i>Oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:11.460
<i>oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:16.470
<i>Perhaps the truth lies
In what you can't see</i>

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:16.470
<i>mienaimono ni koso shinjitsu ga
arukamo nante</i>

00:22:16.590 --> 00:22:19.340
<i>Do you believe that?
If you close your eyes</i>

00:22:16.590 --> 00:22:19.340
<i>kimi wa shinjirukana? me wo tojireba</i>

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:23.930
<i>A new story will begin</i>

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:23.930
<i>hajimaruyo atarashii monogatari</i>

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:30.190
<i>The really important things</i>

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:30.190
<i>taisetsu na mono wa itsudatte</i>

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:34.990
<i>me niwa mienai monosa</i>

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:34.990
<i>Are always things you can't see</i>

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:37.820
<i>namae no nai sora wo miage</i>

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:37.820
<i>Looking up to a nameless sky</i>

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:40.950
<i>hiki komogomo yume wo kazoeta</i>

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:40.950
<i>I bittersweetly counted dreams</i>

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.580
<i>kimi wa jibun ni shoujikikai?</i>

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.580
<i>Are you honest with yourself?</i>

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>kaze ga hana wo kusugutta</i>

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>The wind tickled my nose</i>

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>yamiyo ni magirete oeoeo</i>

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>Lost in the dark night, oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.300
<i>oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.300
<i>Oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:56.760
<i>kimi no ushiro kara oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:56.760
<i>From behind you, oeoeo</i>

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:01.680
<i>oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:01.680
<i>Oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:23:05.810 --> 00:23:08.850
<i>A second moon suddenly appears</i>
<i>along with </i>tanuki<i>.</i>

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:11.810
<i>Dad, Japan's in trouble.</i>

00:23:11.940 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:14.070 --> 00:23:16.940
<i>"Conquer Japan! The 808 Tanuki Army"</i>

00:23:17.070 --> 00:23:19.610
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
